# meta: !!omap
# - {description: Unclassified candidates; usable excludes fatal quality problems.}
# - {quality_note: Blended labels are retained; both overlap fractions must be <= their limits. Zero overlap passes at zero. Use usable.}
# - {overlap_note: 'Label-overlap flux fraction is a proxy, not true contaminating-light fraction.'}
# - {flux_note: Background-subtracted ADU assumed; segment and aperture fluxes are not total fluxes.}
# - {model_settings: '{"max_overlap_area_fraction": 0.15, "max_overlap_flux_fraction": 0.1, "profile_betas": [2.5, 4.0], "max_group_sources":
#     24, "max_fit_pixels": 30000, "max_nfev": 200, "max_reduced_residual": 5.0, "max_coherent_residual": 5.0, "max_score_disagreement":
#     0.03, "minimum_model_snr": 10.0, "minimum_aperture_snr": 5.0, "max_centre_shift": 1.5, "max_fractional_residual": 0.15, "max_bound_neighbour_fraction":
#     0.02, "max_sky_flux_fraction": 0.05, "max_fwhm_moment_factor": 3.0, "minimum_fwhm_upper_bound": 6.0}'}
# - {fallback_note: A larger aperture failed; the original aperture was rechecked and used. Not total flux.}
# - {core_check: Other-label pixels >= 30% of its peak; neighbour peak >= 10 RMS; reject >= 2 such pixels with >= 1% of aperture positive
#     flux. Applies to every source.}
# - {shared_aperture_rule: '>= 3 common pixels above 3 RMS; shared signed flux S/N >= 5; shared/positive aperture flux >= 0.005 for BOTH
#     sources. Reject both; not true contamination fractions.'}
# - {detection_settings: '{"background_box": 128, "saturation_override": null, "artefact_sigma": 3.0, "halo_sigma": 1.5, "artefact_padding":
#     4, "boundary_padding": 4, "smooth_sigma": 1.0, "detection_sigma": 5.0, "growth_sigma": 2.5, "min_pixels": 8, "peak_separation":
#     8, "peak_prominence_sigma": 4.0, "peak_prominence_fraction": 0.1, "min_aperture_radius": 4.0, "max_aperture_radius": 60.0, "ellipse_threshold":
#     1.4, "max_overlap_area_fraction": 0.003, "max_overlap_flux_fraction": 0.003, "right_strip_start": 2450, "sharp_peak_snr": 15.0,
#     "sharp_minor_sigma": 0.65, "sharp_axis_ratio": 2.5, "kron_minimum_snr": 50.0, "kron_scale": 2.5, "kron_minimum_radius": 1.0, "kron_wing_snr":
#     3.0}'}
# - {mask_note: 'Right strip x >= 2450, sharp features, and manually identified cross at (1036, 432); all included in DETMASK.'}
# - {image_sha256: 8575da11936c5c2463c51cff862dfcb0b06f2061dabec8694bb9d6c027ba6db2}
# - {products_sha256: d7d38ad0ff5b23993b44004d324afdcebda864491709643b8c1cc8fe17427955}
# - {reviewed_wings_note: 'Only two visually reviewed positions: 98% of signed flux inside a clean 2.5-times-original-radius circle. Finite-aperture
#     flux, not total flux.'}
# - {reviewed_blends_note: 'Explicit position-selected visual exclusion: crowded outer wings of the source at (2278.612, 3846.148) are
#     not validated by its small-core fit. No global thresholds or aperture sizes changed.'}
# - {local_recovery_note: 'Six screenshot-selected positions only. Padded mask/core veto retained; three-start neighbour fit must pass
#     original model quality cuts plus flux <=3%, start disagreement <=1%, measured S/N >=50. Shared-light exception requires own shared
#     flux <=2% and all rejected partners excluded. Original shared/near-artefact flags retained; no aperture changes or flux subtraction.'}
# - {internal_peak_review_note: 'Only position (647.2980, 2129.2226): two local maxima at smoothing sigma 0.5/0.7, one at sigma 1, in
#     one source label. Provisional visual exclusion from counts; not an automatic deblend or a confirmed object pair.'}
# - {field_review_note: 'Uniform fixed-aperture quality review. Multi-peak flags are provisional, not confirmed blends. Only clean high-S/N
